#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Learn about activity tracking events for the IBM Quantum System service."
msgstr ""
"Scopri gli eventi di tracciamento delle attività per il servizio IBM Quantum"
" System."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activity tracking events for the IBM Quantum System service"
msgstr ""
"Eventi di tracciamento delle attività per il servizio IBM Quantum System"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Activity tracking events for the IBM Quantum System service {#activity-"
"tracking-events-for-the-ibm-quantum-system-service}"
msgstr ""
"Eventi di tracciamento delle attività per il servizio IBM Quantum System "
"{#activity-tracking-events-for-the-ibm-quantum-system-service}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"IBM Cloud&reg; services, such as the IBM&reg; Quantum System service, "
"generate activity tracking events.\n"
msgstr ""
"I servizi IBM Cloud&reg;, come il servizio IBM&reg; Quantum System, generano"
" eventi di tracciamento delle attività.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Activity tracking events report on activities that change the state of a "
"service in IBM Cloud. You can use the events to investigate abnormal "
"activity and critical actions and to comply with regulatory audit "
"requirements.\n"
msgstr ""
"Gli eventi di tracciamento delle attività riportano le attività che "
"modificano lo stato di un servizio in IBM Cloud. Puoi utilizzare gli eventi "
"per esaminare attività anomale e azioni critiche e per soddisfare i "
"requisiti di audit normativi.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can use IBM Cloud Activity Tracker Event Routing, a platform service, to"
" route auditing events in your account to destinations of your choice by "
"configuring targets and routes that define where activity tracking events "
"are sent. For more information, see [About IBM Cloud Activity Tracker Events"
" Routing](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/atracker?topic=atracker-about).\n"
msgstr ""
"Puoi utilizzare IBM Cloud Activity Tracker Event Routing, un servizio della "
"piattaforma, per instradare gli eventi di audit nel tuo account verso "
"destinazioni di tua scelta configurando target e route che definiscono dove "
"vengono inviati gli eventi di tracciamento delle attività. Per ulteriori "
"informazioni, consulta [About IBM Cloud Activity Tracker Events "
"Routing](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/atracker?topic=atracker-about).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can use IBM Cloud Logs to visualize and alert on events that are "
"generated in your account and routed by IBM Cloud Activity Tracker Event "
"Routing to an IBM Cloud Logs instance.\n"
msgstr ""
"Puoi utilizzare IBM Cloud Logs per visualizzare e ricevere avvisi sugli "
"eventi generati nel tuo account e instradati da IBM Cloud Activity Tracker "
"Event Routing a un'istanza di IBM Cloud Logs.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Viewing activity tracking events for the IBM Quantum System service "
"{#viewing-activity-tracking-events-for-the-ibm-quantum-system-service}"
msgstr ""
"Visualizzazione degli eventi di tracciamento delle attività per il servizio "
"IBM Quantum System {#viewing-activity-tracking-events-for-the-ibm-quantum-"
"system-service}"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Launching IBM Cloud Logs from the Observability page {#launching-ibm-cloud-"
"logs-from-the-observability-page}"
msgstr ""
"Avvio di IBM Cloud Logs dalla pagina Observability {#launching-ibm-cloud-"
"logs-from-the-observability-page}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For information on launching the IBM Cloud Logs UI, see the [Launching the "
"UI](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cloud-logs?topic=cloud-logs-instance-"
"launch#instance-launch-cloud-ui) in the IBM Cloud Logs documentation.\n"
msgstr ""
"Per informazioni sull'avvio dell'interfaccia utente di IBM Cloud Logs, "
"consulta [Launching the UI](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cloud-"
"logs?topic=cloud-logs-instance-launch#instance-launch-cloud-ui) nella "
"documentazione di IBM Cloud Logs.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Action | Triggered by |\n"
"| -- | -- |\n"
"| `quantum-computing.direct-access-backend-configuration.read` | Get backend configuration (`GET /v1/backends/{backend-name}/configuration`) |\n"
"| `quantum-computing.direct-access-backend-properties.read` | Get backend properties (`GET /v1/backends/{backend-name}/properties`) |\n"
"| `quantum-computing.direct-access-backend.list` | Get list of backends (`GET /v1/backends`) |\n"
"| `quantum-computing.direct-access-backend.read` | Get backend details (`GET /v1/backends/{backend-name}`) |\n"
"| `quantum-computing.direct-access-job.cancel` | Cancel a job (`POST /v1/jobs/{job-id}/cancel`) |\n"
"| `quantum-computing.direct-access-job.create` | Run a job (`POST /v1/jobs`) |\n"
"| `quantum-computing.direct-access-job.delete` | Delete a job (`DELETE /v1/jobs/{job-id}`) |\n"
"| `quantum-computing.direct-access-job.list` | Get jobs (`GET /v1/jobs`) |\n"
"| `quantum-computing.direct-access-job.read` | Get Job by ID (`GET /v1/jobs/{job-id}`) |\n"
"| `quantum-computing.direct-access-lane-configuration.list` | Get backend lanes configuration (`GET /v1/backends/{backend-name}/lanes`) |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Azione | Attivata da |\n"
"| -- | -- |\n"
"| `quantum-computing.direct-access-backend-configuration.read` | Ottieni la configurazione del backend (`GET /v1/backends/{backend-name}/configuration`) |\n"
"| `quantum-computing.direct-access-backend-properties.read` | Ottieni le proprietà del backend (`GET /v1/backends/{backend-name}/properties`) |\n"
"| `quantum-computing.direct-access-backend.list` | Ottieni l'elenco dei backend (`GET /v1/backends`) |\n"
"| `quantum-computing.direct-access-backend.read` | Ottieni i dettagli del backend (`GET /v1/backends/{backend-name}`) |\n"
"| `quantum-computing.direct-access-job.cancel` | Annulla un job (`POST /v1/jobs/{job-id}/cancel`) |\n"
"| `quantum-computing.direct-access-job.create` | Esegui un job (`POST /v1/jobs`) |\n"
"| `quantum-computing.direct-access-job.delete` | Elimina un job (`DELETE /v1/jobs/{job-id}`) |\n"
"| `quantum-computing.direct-access-job.list` | Ottieni i job (`GET /v1/jobs`) |\n"
"| `quantum-computing.direct-access-job.read` | Ottieni il job tramite ID (`GET /v1/jobs/{job-id}`) |\n"
"| `quantum-computing.direct-access-lane-configuration.list` | Ottieni la configurazione delle corsie del backend (`GET /v1/backends/{backend-name}/lanes`) |\n"
